        "publisherDisplayName": "Wortell Enterprise Security",
        "descriptionHtml": "<p><strong>Note:</strong> Please refer to the following before installing the solution:</p>\n<p>• Review the solution <a href=\"https://github.com/Azure/Azure-Sentinel/tree/master/Solutions/TOPdesk/ReleaseNotes.md\">Release Notes</a></p>\n<p>• There may be <a href=\"https://aka.ms/sentinelsolutionsknownissues\">known issues</a> pertaining to this Solution, please refer to them before installing.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.topdesk.com/en/itsm-software/\">TOPdesk ITSM-software</a> helps busy service teams handle incoming requests, automatically assign tasks to the right people, and see who's doing what - so you can stay ahead instead of just keeping up.</p>\n<p>This Data Connector is used to retrieve TOPdesk Incidents into Microsoft Sentinel.</p>\n<p><strong>Underlying Microsoft Technologies used:</strong>\nThis solution takes a dependency on the following technologies, and some of these dependencies either may be in <a href=\"https://azure.microsoft.com/support/legal/preview-supplemental-terms/\">Preview</a> state or might result in additional ingestion or operational costs</p>\n<ol type=\"a\">\n<li><a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/sentinel/create-codeless-connector\">Codeless Connector Framework</a></li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>Data Connectors:</strong> 1</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://aka.ms/azuresentinel\">Learn more about Microsoft Sentinel</a> | <a href=\"https://aka.ms/azuresentinelsolutionsdoc\">Learn more about Solutions</a></p>\n",
        "contentKind": "Solution",
